{
  "title": "File Manager",
  "description": "A desktop-style, backend-agnostic file manager: directory tree, sidebar locations, breadcrumbs, grid and details views with configurable columns, keyboard navigation, multi-selection, clipboard, drag and drop, uploads, conflict resolution, trash, permissions, lazy loading and pagination, and async operations with progress, retry, cancel and undo. Also exports the standalone FileTree.",
